+### Full pre-release verification (one command)
+
+Run everything — tests, lint, CLI smoke checks, git hygiene, build, wheel smoke — from the repo root:
+
+```powershell
+powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File verify_all.ps1     # full check
